::MCR_U02_L04_Quiz_Q01::
Question ID: MCR_U02_L04_Quiz_Q01
MLA Standard: MLA.MCR.AR.6
Question:
Plan A is 11 + 5m and Plan B is 41 + 2m. Which equation finds the break-even point?
{
=A. 11 + 5m = 41 + 2m#Correct. Break-even means set the two total-cost models equal.
~B. 11 + 5m > 41 + 2m#This compares greater than, but break-even requires equality.
~C. 11m + 5 = 41m + 2#This switches fixed costs and rates.
~D. 11 + 41 = 5m + 2m#This combines unrelated parts instead of setting plan totals equal.
}
